Value HEADER (Neighbor)
Value NEIGHBOR (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value PRIORITY (\d+)
Value STATE (FULL|2WAY|DOWN|ATTEMPT|INIT|EXSTART|EXCHANGE|LOADING)
Value ROLE (DR|BDR|DROTHER|-)
Value DEAD_TIME (\S+)
Value ADDRESS (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

Start
  ^${HEADER} ID\s+Pri\s+State\s+Dead Time\s+Address\s+Interface\s*$$ -> Record Table
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error

Table
  ^${NEIGHBOR}\s+${PRIORITY}\s+${STATE}/\s*${ROLE}\s+${DEAD_TIME}\s+${ADDRESS}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error

EOF
